// "Fateseal(who)" ([CR#701.20a]) — the bare-verb pattern TWIN: "whenever `who`
// fateseals". Expands to the `Act` master form, the performer riding `who` (the
// fact's `actor`).
(
    name: "Fateseal",
    template: "${0} fateseals",
    kinds: [EventFilter],
    params: [Predicate],
    body: Act(verb: Fateseal, who: Param(0)),
)
